//
// Third-party Adreno graphics stack, taken from the Meta Quest 3
// Adreno driver package V@0837.0.7 (module id adreno_gpu_driver v2.3).
//
// NOT an official Qualcomm release.
//
// The shared libraries here are referenced directly from the OEM prebuilt
// module definitions in vendor/oneplus/sm8450-common/Android.bp, which use
// Soong select() on the soong_config variable gpu_oplus.driver_q3 to pick
// between these files and the original OEM blobs. No module is declared in
// this directory on purpose: declaring one would install the same path twice.
//
// Files are stored through Git LFS, see .gitattributes.
//
